      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "political_protest_stereotype",
      "label": "Political Protest as Childish or Infantilized",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that political activism, particularly protesting, is an immature or overly emotional activity, often associated with 'mommy' figures or 'big boys' who are being pampered. This frames protest as something that should be done by children or under maternal supervision, thereby mocking its seriousness and adult relevance.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_ffe75d48"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_bf9a3aac",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "maternal_role_stereotype",
      "label": "Maternal Role as Nurturing and Controlling",
      "description": "The image uses the stereotype of the maternal figure as nurturing, caring, and sometimes controlling, often associated with domesticity and emotional regulation. In this meme, the maternal figure is used to infantilize the protestor, implying that his political action is emotionally driven and needs to be 'fed' or 'taken care of' like a child.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_ffe75d48"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_e9242ed1",
      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "infantilization_stereotype",
      "label": "Infantilization of Adult Political Actors",
      "description": "The meme employs the stereotype of infantilizing adults by portraying them as children who need to be fed and cared for, thereby undermining their agency and seriousness. This is a form of ableism and misogyny, as it reduces adult political engagement to a childish, domestic activity.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
